{"step_index":187,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T09:58:43Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated walkthrough with the full Model Context Protocol (MCP) server architecture, tools, resources, and configuration details for Get Into Feed.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Agency Redesign & Model Context Protocol (MCP) Backend Integration\\n\\nWe have transformed **Get Into Feed** into India's #1 digital growth agency website and integrated a **full-featured Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server** directly into the backend.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔌 Backend MCP (Model Context Protocol) Integration\\n\\nThe backend is now equipped with **dual-transport MCP support** (Stdio & HTTP/SSE), allowing AI assistants, agents, Antigravity, Claude Desktop, Cursor, and custom automation scripts to interact with the agency's growth data, tools, and lead pipelines.\\n\\n### 1. Dual Transport Architecture\\n- **Stdio Transport**: [`backend/mcp-server.js`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/backend/mcp-server.js)\\n  - Compliant with JSON-RPC 2.0 protocol over standard I/O.\\n  - Can be started via `npm run mcp` or configured in any MCP client.\\n- **HTTP & SSE Transport**: [`backend/routes/mcpRoutes.js`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/backend/routes/mcpRoutes.js)\\n  - **`POST /api/mcp`**: Direct JSON-RPC 2.0 execution endpoint.\\n  - **`GET /api/mcp/sse`**: Server-Sent Events real-time transport.\\n  - **`GET /api/mcp/health`**: Health status & capabilities overview.\\n  - **`GET /api/mcp/tools`**: Available tools catalog.\\n  - **`GET /api/mcp/resources`**: Available resources catalog.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. Available MCP Tools\\n\\n| Tool Name | Description | Key Parameters |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| `get_agency_services` | Query all active growth services (Performance Ads, SEO, React Web, Creative, Retention, Analytics) | `category` (optional) |\\n| `get_case_studies` | Query verified ROI metrics and client case studies | `industry` (optional: `d2c`, `b2b`, `edtech`, `realestate`) |\\n| `calculate_growth_roi` | Compute projected high-intent visits, qualified leads, ROAS multiplier, and revenue lift | `monthlyBudgetInr` (number), `industry` (string) |\\n| `create_growth_lead` | Submit a qualified client lead / growth inquiry directly to the agency CRM | `name\n<truncated 2186 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with MCP documentation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough with MCP details\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
