{"step_index":196,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T09:58:59Z","content":"Aapka backend ab **Model Context Protocol (MCP)** ke sath fully connected aur integrated hai! 🚀\n\n---\n\n### 🔌 Kya Kya MCP Capabilities Add Huyi Hain:\n\n#### 1. **Dual Transport MCP Architecture (Stdio + HTTP/SSE)**\nAapka agency backend ab 2 tareeko se MCP clients (Antigravity, Cursor, Claude Desktop, AI Agents) se connect ho sakta hai:\n1. **Stdio Transport (CLI / Local Agent)**: [`backend/mcp-server.js`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/backend/mcp-server.js)\n   - Command: `npm run mcp` ya `node backend/mcp-server.js`\n   - Fully JSON-RPC 2.0 compliant.\n2. **HTTP & Server-Sent Events (SSE) Transport (Live Express Server)**: [`backend/routes/mcpRoutes.js`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/backend/routes/mcpRoutes.js)\n   - **`POST /api/mcp`**: Direct JSON-RPC 2.0 tool execution endpoint.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/sse`**: Real-time SSE stream for remote agents.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/health`**: MCP status & capabilities overview.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/tools`**: Available tools catalog.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/resources`**: Available resources catalog.\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Available MCP Tools (AI Agents Ke Liye):\n\n| Tool Name | Kaam Kya Karta Hai | Parameters |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `get_agency_services` | Agency ke sabhi services (Ads, SEO, React Web, Creative, Retention, Analytics) retrieve karta hai | `category` (optional) |\n| `get_case_studies` | Verified client outcomes (Veloura 4.8x ROAS, SkillCraft +312% leads, Zentura $1.4M pipeline) deta hai | `industry` (`d2c`, `b2b`, `edtech`, `realestate`) |\n| `calculate_growth_roi` | Monthly ad budget (INR) aur industry ke basis par live ROI, leads, aur revenue calculate karta hai | `monthlyBudgetInr`, `industry` |\n| `create_growth_lead` | Inbound client leads / proposal inquiries ko backend database me save karta hai | `name`, `email`, `phone`, `company`, `service`, `budget`, `message` |\n| `request_360_growth_audit` | Kisi bhi business website ke liye instant 360° growth audit request submit karta hai | `company`, `website`, `growthBlockers`, `name`, `email`, `phone` |\n| `get_lead_submissions` | Admin ke liye latest inbound inquiries fetch karta hai | `limit` (default: 20) |\n| `get_blog_posts` | Published marketing playbooks aur articles retrieve karta hai | `category` (optional) |\n\n---\n\n### 📦 Available MCP Resources (`mcp://...`):\n- **`mcp://getintofeed/overview`**: Agency credentials, Google Premier Partner 2026 status, Meta certification, and stats.\n- **`mcp://getintofeed/pricing`**: Sprint tiers (Starter ₹39k, Scale ₹79k, Enterprise ₹1.49L) aur 45-day guarantee.\n- **`mcp://getintofeed/benchmarks`**: Indian digital marketing industry CPC, conversion rates, and ROAS benchmarks.\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ MCP Configuration Files:\n- [`.agents/mcp_config.json`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/.agents/mcp_config.json) (Antigravity workspace configuration)\n- [`mcp_config.json`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/mcp_config.json) (Root configuration)\n- [`backend/package.json`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/backend/package.json) (Added `\"mcp\": \"node mcp-server.js\"`)\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Run & Test Commands:\n- **Stdio MCP Server run karne ke liye**:\n  ```powershell\n  npm run mcp\n  ```\n- **Backend start karne par MCP automatic on rahega**:\n  ```powershell\n  npm start\n  ```\n  *(MCP HTTP Endpoint: `http://localhost:5000/api/mcp`, SSE Endpoint: `http://localhost:5000/api/mcp/sse`)*\n\nDocumentation details check karne ke liye aap [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/ashis/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc/walkthrough.md) open kar sakte hain!"}
